msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "Soalan Lazim"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:21
msgid "Is it possible to purchase access without expiration date?"
msgstr "Adakah mungkin untuk membeli akses tanpa tarikh luput?"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:29
msgid "Yes, I can provide you with a custom offer for full access based on usage. Please contact me through the support chat to discuss your needs and receive a personalized offer."
msgstr "Ya, saya boleh menawarkan tawaran khusus untuk akses penuh berdasarkan penggunaan. Sila hubungi saya melalui sembang sokongan untuk membincangkan keperluan anda dan menerima tawaran yang diperibadikan."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:40
msgid "Call duration limits?"
msgstr "Had masa panggilan?"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:48
msgid "No, there are no call duration limits. You can talk as long as you want during the selected time period."
msgstr "Tidak, tiada had tempoh panggilan. Anda boleh berbual selama mana yang anda mahu dalam tempoh masa yang dipilih."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/HoursPaymentModal/FaqHours.tsx:25
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:59
msgid "Is this a subscription?"
msgstr "Adakah ini langganan?"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:67
msgid "No, you are purchasing full access for a selected period of time. There is no auto-renewal, you can buy full access again when your current period ends."
msgstr "Tidak, anda membeli akses penuh untuk tempoh masa yang dipilih. Tiada pembaharuan automatik, anda boleh membeli akses penuh semula apabila tempoh semasa anda tamat."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:78
msgid "Daily Limits?"
msgstr "Had Harian?"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:86
msgid "No, there are no daily limits. You can talk as many times as you want during the selected time period."
msgstr "Tidak, tiada had harian. Anda boleh bercakap sebanyak kali yang anda mahu dalam tempoh masa yang dipilih."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:97
msgid "Can I use it on smartphone?"
msgstr "Bolehkah saya menggunakannya pada telefon pintar?"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:105
msgid "Yes, you can use it on your smartphone. The service is fully accessible from mobile devices. Simply open the website in your mobile browser and log in to your account."
msgstr "Ya, anda boleh menggunakannya pada telefon pintar anda. Perkhidmatan ini boleh diakses sepenuhnya daripada peranti mudah alih. Hanya buka laman web dalam pelayar mudah alih anda dan log masuk ke akaun anda."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Landing/Price/PricePage.tsx:90
#: src/features/Usage/HoursPaymentModal/FaqHours.tsx:44
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:116
msgid "Can I do a refund after purchase?"
msgstr "Bolehkah saya membuat bayaran balik selepas pembelian?"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/Subscription/FaqSubscription.tsx:117
msgid "Yes. If you are not satisfied with the service, you can request a refund on the Profile/Payment History page, and we will process it."
msgstr "Ya. Jika anda tidak berpuas hati dengan perkhidmatan ini, anda boleh meminta bayaran balik di halaman Profil/Sejarah Pembayaran, dan kami akan memprosesnya."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/HoursPaymentModal/PaymentSuccess.tsx:32
msgid "Payment successful!"
msgstr "Pembayaran berjaya!"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/Usage/HoursPaymentModal/PaymentSuccess.tsx:36
