msgstr "Hotel Daftar Masuk"

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/RolePlay/scenarios/hotel-check-in.ts:9
msgid "Practice checking into a hotel, confirming your reservation, asking about amenities, and solving common problems at reception."
msgstr "Berlatih mendaftar masuk ke hotel, mengesahkan tempahan anda, bertanya tentang kemudahan, dan menyelesaikan masalah biasa di kaunter penerimaan tetamu."

#. js-lingui-explicit-id
#: src/features/RolePlay/scenarios/hotel-check-in.ts:13
msgid ""
"Checking into a hotel usually follows a predictable pattern. The receptionist confirms your identity and reservation, explains the hotel’s services, and gives you access to your room.\n"
"\n"
"Knowing a few key phrases can make the process much easier, especially when you are travelling in a country where you do not speak the local language confidently.\n"
"\n"
"## What You May Need at Check-In\n"
"\n"
"The receptionist may ask you for:\n"
"\n"
"- Your full name\n"
"- A passport or identity document\n"
"- Your booking confirmation\n"
"- A payment card\n"
"- The number of guests\n"
"- Your expected check-out date\n"
"\n"
"You can begin the conversation with:\n"
"\n"
"- “Hello, I have a reservation.”\n"
"- “Hi, I’d like to check in.”\n"
"- “The reservation should be under Alex Dmowski.”\n"
"- “I booked the room through a booking website.”\n"
"- “Here is my booking confirmation.”\n"
"\n"
"If the receptionist cannot find your reservation, stay calm and provide more details:\n"
"\n"
"- “Could you check the booking number?”\n"
"- “I received a confirmation email yesterday.”\n"
"- “The reservation may be under my partner’s name.”\n"
"- “Would it help if I showed you the confirmation?”\n"
"\n"
"## Confirm the Important Details\n"
"\n"
"Before accepting the room, confirm that the reservation details are correct.\n"
"\n"
"You may want to check:\n"
"\n"
"- The room type\n"
"- The number of nights\n"
"- The total price\n"
"- Whether breakfast is included\n"
"- The number and size of beds\n"
"- The check-out time\n"
"- Any additional fees or deposits\n"
"\n"
"Useful questions include:\n"
"\n"
"- “Could you confirm which room type I booked?”\n"
"- “Is breakfast included in the price?”\n"
"- “What time is check-out?”\n"
"- “Is there a security deposit?”\n"
"- “Are there any additional charges?”\n"
"- “Has the room already been paid for?”\n"
"- “Could I have a receipt, please?”\n"
"\n"
"Do not be afraid to ask the receptionist to repeat information:\n"
"\n"
"- “Sorry, could you repeat that?”\n"
"- “Could you speak a little more slowly, please?”\n"
"- “Did you say check-out is at eleven?”\n"
"- “Could you write that down for me?”\n"
"\n"
"## Ask About Hotel Services\n"
"\n"
"Check-in is a good time to ask practical questions about your stay.\n"
"\n"
"### Wi-Fi\n"
"\n"
"- “Is Wi-Fi included?”\n"
"- “What is the Wi-Fi password?”\n"
"- “Does the Wi-Fi work inside the rooms?”\n"
"\n"
"### Breakfast\n"
"\n"
"- “What time is breakfast served?”\n"
"- “Where is the breakfast area?”\n"
"- “Do you have vegetarian options?”\n"
"- “Can I add breakfast to my reservation?”\n"
"\n"
"### Hotel facilities\n"
"\n"
"- “Does the hotel have a gym?”\n"
"- “Is there a place where I can leave my luggage?”\n"
"- “Do you have laundry service?”\n"
"- “Is room service available?”\n"
"- “Is there a restaurant in the hotel?”\n"
"\n"
"### Transport and local information\n"
"\n"
"- “Could you help me call a taxi?”\n"
"- “What is the easiest way to get to the city centre?”\n"
"- “Is there a bus stop nearby?”\n"
"- “Could you recommend a restaurant in the area?”\n"
"\n"
"## Make a Special Request\n"
"\n"
"It is best to make important requests before arriving, but you can also ask at reception.\n"
"\n"
"Common requests include:\n"
"\n"
"- A quiet room\n"
"- A room on a higher or lower floor\n"
"- Two separate beds\n"
"- A larger bed\n"
"- A baby cot\n"
"- An accessible room\n"
"- Extra towels or pillows\n"
"- Early check-in\n"
"- Late check-out\n"
"- A room away from the lift\n"
"\n"
"Useful phrases:\n"
"\n"
"- “Would it be possible to have a quiet room?”\n"
"- “Could I have a room away from the lift?”\n"
"- “Do you have a room on a higher floor?”\n"
"- “Could we have two separate beds?”\n"
"- “Would it be possible to check out later?”\n"
"- “Could you send an extra towel to the room?”\n"
"\n"
"Using “Could I…?”, “Would it be possible…?” and “Do you have…?” makes your request sound polite and natural.\n"
"\n"
"## Handle Common Problems\n"
"\n"
"Sometimes the room is not ready, the booking details are incorrect, or the room does not match what you reserved.\n"
"\n"
"### The room is not ready\n"
"\n"
"- “Do you know when the room will be ready?”\n"
"- “Could I leave my luggage here?”\n"
"- “Could you let me know when I can check in?”\n"
"- “Is there somewhere I can wait?”\n"
"\n"
"### The reservation cannot be found\n"
"\n"
"- “I have a confirmation email. Could you check it?”\n"
"- “Could you search using the booking reference?”\n"
"- “The reservation may be under a different name.”\n"
"- “Could you contact the booking platform?”\n"
"\n"
"### The room is different from the booking\n"
"\n"
"- “I believe I booked a double room.”\n"
"- “My confirmation says that breakfast is included.”\n"
"- “I requested two separate beds.”\n"
"- “Could you check the original reservation?”\n"
"- “Is another room available?”\n"
"\n"
"### There is a problem with the room\n"
"\n"
"- “The air conditioning does not seem to work.”\n"
"- “The room has not been cleaned yet.”\n"
"- “There is a lot of noise coming from the next room.”\n"
"- “The Wi-Fi is not working in my room.”\n"
"- “Could someone take a look at it?”\n"
"- “Would it be possible to change rooms?”\n"
"\n"
"Describe the problem clearly, explain what you expected, and ask for a specific solution.\n"
"\n"
"## Understand Common Receptionist Questions\n"
"\n"
"A receptionist may ask:\n"
"\n"
"- “May I have your name?”\n"
"- “Could I see your passport or ID?”\n"
"- “Do you have your booking confirmation?”\n"
"- “How many nights will you be staying?”\n"
"- “Will you be paying by card or cash?”\n"
"- “Would you like breakfast included?”\n"
"- “Do you need help with your luggage?”\n"
"- “Would you like a wake-up call?”\n"
"- “Do you have any special requests?”\n"
"\n"
"You do not need to give long answers. Clear and direct responses are usually best.\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
"> “Yes, the reservation is under Dmowski. I’ll be staying for three nights, and I’ll pay by card.”\n"
"\n"
"## A Simple Check-In Conversation\n"
"\n"
"A typical conversation may follow this structure:\n"
"\n"
"1. Greet the receptionist.\n"
"2. Say that you have a reservation.\n"
"3. Give your name and identification.\n"
"4. Confirm your booking details.\n"
"5. Ask about breakfast, Wi-Fi, or check-out.\n"
"6. Make any special requests.\n"
"7. Collect your room key and directions.\n"
"8. Thank the receptionist.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"> **Guest:** Hello, I have a reservation under Dmowski.  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Certainly. May I see your passport, please?  \n"
"> **Guest:** Of course. Here you are. Is breakfast included in my booking?  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Yes, it is served from seven until ten.  \n"
"> **Guest:** Great. Could you also tell me the Wi-Fi password?  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** It is written on your key card.  \n"
"> **Guest:** Thank you. What time is check-out?  \n"
"> **Receptionist:** Check-out is at eleven.  \n"
"> **Guest:** Perfect. Thank you for your help.\n"
"\n"
"## Practice Scenario\n"
"\n"
"In this roleplay, you have arrived at a hotel where you already have a reservation. The AI receptionist will ask for your details, explain the hotel’s services, and respond to your questions.\n"
"\n"
"During the conversation, try to:\n"
"\n"
"- Introduce yourself and confirm your reservation.\n"
"- Ask at least two questions about the hotel.\n"
"- Make one polite request.\n"
"- Confirm an important detail by repeating it.\n"
"- Respond to an unexpected issue if one occurs.\n"
"\n"
"Focus on communicating clearly rather than using perfect grammar. A successful check-in is one where both you and the receptionist understand what needs to happen next."
msgstr ""
"Mendaftar masuk ke hotel biasanya mengikuti pola yang dijangka. Resepsionis mengesahkan identiti dan tempahan anda, menerangkan perkhidmatan hotel, dan memberikan akses ke bilik anda.\n"
"\n"
"Mengetahui beberapa frasa penting dapat mempermudah proses ini, terutamanya ketika anda melancong di negara tempat anda tidak bertutur bahasa tempatan dengan yakin.\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang Mungkin Anda Perlukan Semasa Mendaftar Masuk\n"
"\n"
"Resepsionis mungkin akan meminta anda:\n"
"\n"
"- Nama penuh anda\n"
"- Pasport atau dokumen pengenalan diri\n"
"- Pengesahan tempahan anda\n"
"- Kad pembayaran\n"
"- Bilangan tetamu\n"
"- Tarikh dijangka anda daftar keluar\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh memulakan perbualan dengan:\n"
"\n"
"- “Hello, saya ada tempahan.”\n"
"- “Hi, saya ingin mendaftar masuk.”\n"
"- “Tempahan sepatutnya atas nama Alex Dmowski.”\n"
"- “Saya tempah bilik melalui laman tempahan.”\n"
"- “Ini adalah pengesahan tempahan saya.”\n"
"\n"
"Jika resepsionis tidak dapat mencari tempahan anda, tetap tenang dan berikan lebih banyak perincian:\n"
"\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda memeriksa nombor tempahan?”\n"
"- “Saya menerima emel pengesahan semalam.”\n"
"- “Tempahan mungkin atas nama pasangan saya.”\n"
"- “Adakah ia membantu jika saya tunjukkan pengesahan?”\n"
"\n"
"## Sahkan Butiran Penting\n"
"\n"
"Sebelum menerima bilik, pastikan bahawa butiran tempahan adalah betul.\n"
"\n"
"Anda mungkin ingin memeriksa:\n"
"\n"
"- Jenis bilik\n"
"- Bilangan malam\n"
"- Jumlah harga\n"
"- Sama ada sarapan telah termasuk\n"
"- Bilangan dan saiz katil\n"
"- Masa daftar keluar\n"
"- Apa-apa yuran atau deposit tambahan\n"
"\n"
"Soalan yang berguna termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda sahkan jenis bilik yang saya tempah?”\n"
"- “Adakah sarapan termasuk dalam harga?”\n"
"- “Pukul berapa masa daftar keluar?”\n"
"- “Adakah terdapat deposit keselamatan?”\n"
"- “Adakah terdapat caj tambahan?”\n"
"- “Adakah bilik telah dibayar?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya mendapatkan resit, sila?”\n"
"\n"
"Jangan takut untuk meminta resepsionis mengulangi maklumat:\n"
"\n"
"- “Maaf, bolehkah anda ulangi itu?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda bercakap dengan lebih perlahan?”\n"
"- “Adakah anda berkata daftar keluar pada sebelas?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda tulis itu untuk saya?”\n"
"\n"
"## Tanya Mengenai Perkhidmatan Hotel\n"
"\n"
"Mendaftar masuk adalah masa yang baik untuk bertanya soalan praktikal mengenai penginapan anda.\n"
"\n"
"### Wi-Fi\n"
"\n"
"- “Adakah Wi-Fi termasuk?”\n"
"- “Apakah kata laluan Wi-Fi?”\n"
"- “Adakah Wi-Fi berfungsi di dalam bilik?”\n"
"\n"
"### Sarapan\n"
"\n"
"- “Pukul berapa sarapan disediakan?”\n"
"- “Di mana kawasan sarapan?”\n"
"- “Adakah anda mempunyai pilihan vegetarian?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya tambah sarapan ke dalam tempahan saya?”\n"
"\n"
"### Kemudahan Hotel\n"
"\n"
"- “Adakah hotel mempunyai gimnasium?”\n"
"- “Adakah terdapat tempat di mana saya boleh tinggalkan bagasi saya?”\n"
"- “Adakah anda mempunyai perkhidmatan dobi?”\n"
"- “Adakah perkhidmatan bilik tersedia?”\n"
"- “Adakah terdapat restoran di hotel?”\n"
"\n"
"### Pengangkutan dan maklumat tempatan\n"
"\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda bantu saya panggil teksi?”\n"
"- “Apakah cara paling mudah untuk ke pusat bandar?”\n"
"- “Adakah terdapat hentian bas berdekatan?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda syorkan restoran di kawasan ini?”\n"
"\n"
"## Buat Permintaan Khas\n"
"\n"
"Lebih baik membuat permintaan penting sebelum tiba, tetapi anda juga boleh bertanya di kaunter penyambut tetamu.\n"
"\n"
"Permintaan biasa termasuk:\n"
"\n"
"- Bilik yang tenang\n"
"- Bilik di lantai lebih tinggi atau lebih rendah\n"
"- Dua katil berasingan\n"
"- Katil yang lebih besar\n"
"- Katil bayi\n"
"- Bilik yang boleh diakses\n"
"- Tuala atau bantal tambahan\n"
"- Mendaftar masuk awal\n"
"- Mendaftar keluar lewat\n"
"- Bilik yang jauh dari lif\n"
"\n"
"Frasa yang berguna:\n"
"\n"
"- “Adakah mungkin untuk mendapatkan bilik yang tenang?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya mendapatkan bilik yang jauh dari lif?”\n"
"- “Adakah anda mempunyai bilik di lantai lebih tinggi?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah kami mempunyai dua katil berasingan?”\n"
"- “Adakah mungkin untuk mendaftar keluar kemudian?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda hantar tuala tambahan ke bilik?”\n"
"\n"
"Menggunakan “Bolehkah saya…?”, “Adakah mungkin…?” dan “Adakah anda mempunyai…?” akan membuat permintaan anda terdengar sopan dan semulajadi.\n"
"\n"
"## Mengendalikan Masalah Biasa\n"
"\n"
"Kadang-kadang bilik tidak siap, butiran tempahan salah, atau bilik tidak sesuai dengan apa yang anda tempah.\n"
"\n"
"### Bilik tidak siap\n"
"\n"
"- “Adakah anda tahu bila bilik akan siap?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya tinggalkan bagasi saya di sini?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda beritahu saya bila saya boleh mendaftar masuk?”\n"
"- “Adakah terdapat tempat saya boleh menunggu?”\n"
"\n"
"### Tempahan tidak dapat dijumpai\n"
"\n"
"- “Saya ada emel pengesahan. Bolehkah anda memeriksanya?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda mencari menggunakan rujukan tempahan?”\n"
"- “Tempahan mungkin menggunakan nama lain.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda hubungi platform tempahan?”\n"
"\n"
"### Bilik berbeza daripada tempahan\n"
"\n"
"- “Saya percaya saya telah tempah bilik double.”\n"
"- “Pengakuan saya mengatakan bahawa sarapan telah termasuk.”\n"
"- “Saya meminta dua katil berasingan.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah anda memeriksa tempahan asal?”\n"
"- “Adakah bilik lain tersedia?”\n"
"\n"
"### Terdapat masalah dengan bilik\n"
"\n"
"- “Penyejuk udara nampaknya tidak berfungsi.”\n"
"- “Bilik belum dibersihkan lagi.”\n"
"- “Terdapat banyak bunyi dari bilik sebelah.”\n"
"- “Wi-Fi tidak berfungsi di bilik saya.”\n"
"- “Bolehkah seseorang memeriksanya?”\n"
"- “Adakah mungkin untuk menukar bilik?”\n"
"\n"
"Jelaskan masalah dengan jelas, terangkan apa yang anda harapkan, dan minta penyelesaian tertentu.\n"
"\n"
"## Fahami Soalan Biasa dari Resepsionis\n"
"\n"
"Seorang resepsionis mungkin bertanya:\n"
"\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya mendapat nama anda?”\n"
"- “Bolehkah saya lihat pasport atau ID anda?”\n"
"- “Adakah anda mempunyai pengesahan tempahan?”\n"
"- “Berapa malam anda akan menginap?”\n"
"- “Adakah anda akan membayar dengan kad atau tunai?”\n"
"- “Adakah anda mahu sarapan termasuk?”\n"
"- “Adakah anda perlukan bantuan dengan bagasi anda?”\n"
"- “Adakah anda mahu panggilan bangun tidur?”\n"
"- “Adakah anda mempunyai sebarang permintaan khas?”\n"
"\n"
"Anda tidak perlu memberikan jawapan panjang. Jawapan yang jelas dan langsung biasanya adalah yang terbaik.\n"
"\n"
"Sebagai contoh:\n"
"\n"
"> “Ya, tempahan atas nama Dmowski. Saya akan menginap selama tiga malam, dan saya akan bayar dengan kad.”\n"
"\n"
"## Perbualan Mendaftar Masuk yang Mudah\n"
"\n"
"Perbualan biasa mungkin mengikut struktur ini:\n"
"\n"
"1. Sapa resepsionis.\n"
"2. Beritahu bahawa anda mempunyai tempahan.\n"
"3. Berikan nama dan pengenalan diri anda.\n"
"4. Sahkan butiran tempahan anda.\n"
"5. Tanya mengenai sarapan, Wi-Fi, atau masa daftar keluar.\n"
"6. Buat sebarang permintaan khas.\n"
"7. Ambil kunci bilik dan arahan.\n"
"8. Ucapkan terima kasih kepada resepsionis.\n"
"\n"
"Contoh:\n"
"\n"
"> **Tetamu:** Hello, saya ada tempahan atas nama Dmowski.  \n"
"> **Resepsionis:** Sudah tentu. Bolehkah saya lihat pasport anda, sila?  \n"
"> **Tetamu:** Sudah tentu. Ini dia. Adakah sarapan termasuk dalam tempahan saya?  \n"
"> **Resepsionis:** Ya, ia disediakan dari pukul tujuh hingga sepuluh.  \n"
"> **Tetamu:** Bagus. Bolehkah anda juga beritahu saya kata laluan Wi-Fi?  \n"
"> **Resepsionis:** Ia ditulis pada kad kunci anda.  \n"
"> **Tetamu:** Terima kasih. Pukul berapa masa daftar keluar?  \n"
"> **Resepsionis:** Daftar keluar adalah pada sebelas.  \n"
"> **Tetamu:** Sempurna. Terima kasih atas bantuan anda.\n"
"\n"
"## Senario Latihan\n"
"\n"
"Dalam permainan peranan ini, anda telah tiba di hotel di mana anda sudah mempunyai tempahan. Resepsionis AI akan meminta butiran anda, menerangkan perkhidmatan hotel, dan menjawab soalan anda.\n"
"\n"
"Semasa perbualan, cuba untuk:\n"
"\n"
"- Memperkenalkan diri dan mengesahkan tempahan anda.\n"
"- Tanya sekurang-kurangnya dua soalan mengenai hotel.\n"
"- Buat satu permintaan sopan.\n"
"- Sahkan butiran penting dengan mengulanginya.\n"
"- Tanggapi isu yang tidak dijangka jika berlaku.\n"
"\n"
"Fokus untuk berkomunikasi dengan jelas daripada menggunakan tatabahasa yang sempurna. Mendaftar masuk yang berjaya adalah apabila anda dan resepsionis memahami apa yang perlu dilakukan seterusnya."

