msgid ""
"This is a classic, free-form AI assistant — similar to ChatGPT.\n"
"\n"
"You can ask questions, explore ideas, solve problems, or just talk things through.  \n"
"There are no strict roles, scenarios, or scripts — just a natural conversation.\n"
"\n"
"## What you can use this assistant for\n"
"\n"
"- Asking general questions  \n"
"- Getting explanations or summaries  \n"
"- Brainstorming ideas  \n"
"- Solving everyday problems  \n"
"- Writing, rewriting, or improving text  \n"
"- Thinking out loud and exploring thoughts  \n"
"\n"
"## How the conversation works\n"
"\n"
"You talk to the assistant like you would in a normal chat.  \n"
"Ask follow-up questions, change topics, or go deeper whenever you want.\n"
"\n"
"The assistant adapts to your style — short answers, detailed explanations, or step-by-step help.\n"
"\n"
"## Best for\n"
"\n"
"- Everyday conversations  \n"
"- Quick help and clarification  \n"
"- Open-ended discussions  \n"
"- When you don’t need a specific role-play or scenario  \n"
"\n"
"Just start typing — the assistant is ready.\n"
""
msgstr ""
"Ini adalah pembantu AI berbentukkan bebas klasik — serupa dengan ChatGPT.\n"
"\n"
"Anda boleh bertanya soalan, meneroka idea, menyelesaikan masalah, atau sekadar berbual.  \n"
"Tiada peranan, senario, atau skrip yang ketat — hanya perbualan semula jadi.\n"
"\n"
"## Apa yang anda boleh gunakan pembantu ini untuk\n"
"\n"
"- Menanyakan soalan umum  \n"
"- Mendapatkan penjelasan atau ringkasan  \n"
"- Mencetuskan idea  \n"
"- Menyelesaikan masalah harian  \n"
"- Menulis, menulis semula, atau memperbaiki teks  \n"
"- Berfikir secara terbuka dan meneroka fikiran  \n"
"\n"
"## Bagaimana perbualan berfungsi\n"
"\n"
"Anda bercakap dengan pembantu seperti yang anda lakukan dalam chat biasa.  \n"
"Bertanya soalan susulan, mengubah topik, atau mendalami bila-bila masa anda mahu.\n"
"\n"
"Pembantu menyesuaikan diri dengan gaya anda — jawapan pendek, penjelasan terperinci, atau bantuan langkah demi langkah.\n"
"\n"
"## Terbaik untuk\n"
"\n"
"- Perbualan harian  \n"
"- Bantuan dan penjelasan cepat  \n"
"- Perbincangan tanpa batasan  \n"
"- Apabila anda tidak memerlukan peranan atau senario tertentu  \n"
"\n"
"Hanya mula menaip — pembantu sudah bersedia."

